For you after all as they say on the show meddling when you don't need to is the essence of being a hero

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:21.480
That must mean I'm a hero then right?(Sorry but,no)

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:24.959
Maybe my Quirk is the incredible ability to JUMP to conclusions ( get it?)

00:03:25.290 --> 00:03:30.779
To begin we need to look a bit closer at the range of quirks present in this universe you see the my hero quirks fall

00:03:30.780 --> 00:03:33.059
into one of three broad category types

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:38.309
Transformation Mutant and Emitter Transformation type Quirks as the name implies

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:41.550
Transform or change the form of the user's body in some way

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:47.850
Or adds a new feature to the users body for a limited amount of time, for example one transformation Quirk gives the user the power

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:50.459
To harden any part of their body thereby increasing its

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:57.899
Resistance and defensive capabilities another possessed by the character mount lady is able to transform into a giant version of herself pretty self-explanatory

00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:04.410
Moving on Mutant type Quirks unlike Transformations are permanent changes to the user's physiology

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:11.999
These are quirks like Frappys frog form Ogiros tail and Tohru's invisibility these quirks can't be turned off and then finally there's the emitter

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:15.510
Type Quirks which are pretty much everything else they're defined as being

00:04:15.910 --> 00:04:20.729
Activation based so they can be turned on and off and unlike the other two categories emitter Quirks

00:04:20.729 --> 00:04:25.019
Don't actually alter the user's appearance instead the users just able to generate

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:29.370
substances or change certain materials around them at will this includes everything from

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:36.600
Emitting an aroma that puts people to sleep to emitting sweat that happens to explode more unusual examples of emitter quirks belong to showTazawa

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:42.330
who can cancel the quirks of others just by looking at them and to toshishinso who can brainwash anyone who answers one

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:46.049
Of his questions thereby forcing them to do what he says and between those three

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:51.089
Classifications that encompasses all known Quirks in this universe equipped with that knowledge now

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:54.119
Let's examine all might's Quirk one for all even though

00:04:54.120 --> 00:05:00.640
It's technically one Quirk one for all is actually a combination of two very separate powers first a Quirk that

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:06.460
Stockpiles power much like a battery storing energy and second a Quirk that can be passed on to others

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:09.220
Just like the passing of a torch as a result of this odd

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:14.029
Combination of powers one for all makes each new person to inherit it stronger than the last!

00:05:14.029 --> 00:05:21.400
one person who proves the power than hands it off to another person it continues to grow as its passed along

00:05:21.539 --> 00:05:28.158
It's how All Might user No:8 is able to be the uncontested greatest hero in the world, and how Deku all might's

00:05:28.319 --> 00:05:33.558
Successor presumably rises to that exact same status hence the story of My Hero Academia

00:05:33.599 --> 00:05:39.528
This is the story of how I became the world's greatest hero, but here's where things start to get suspicious

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:43.069
This is all might's body when he's not using the Quirk

00:05:43.069 --> 00:05:47.808
And this is his body when he is using the Quirk now based on these images

00:05:47.809 --> 00:05:54.949
You would think that one for all would be classified as a Transformation style Quirk right all might's body is clearly undergoing a huge

00:05:55.379 --> 00:06:00.528
Transformation every time he activates the power growing in size and muscle mass ( DEM 20 BICEPS)by like a hundredfold

00:06:00.749 --> 00:06:07.278
But it's not the manga very explicitly classifies it as an emitter style Quirk, which again

00:06:07.279 --> 00:06:14.989
we just reviewed and are defined by not altering the user's appearance now that might seem like it's a really minor distinction a

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:18.139
Really small nit to pick as to how this Quirk works

00:06:18.139 --> 00:06:23.418
But then look at this! when Deku uses one for all his body doesn't change

00:06:23.419 --> 00:06:28.278
He remains the lean scrawny kid that we've seen throughout the series and before you ask no

00:06:28.279 --> 00:06:35.119
That's not just because he's only using 5% of one for all's power in the manga even when Deku pushes his power output over

00:06:35.249 --> 00:06:39.349
20% we still don't see any signs of Deku's muscles growing AT ALL!

00:06:39.349 --> 00:06:44.658
And this is a very MINOR spoiler for the manga, so if you don't want to be spoiled just skip ahead a few seconds

00:06:44.659 --> 00:06:51.079
But shortly beyond where we've seen in the show Deku is able to temporarily use a hundred percent and even an incredible 1

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:56.299
Million percent of one for alls power and yet his body still remains the same

00:06:56.300 --> 00:07:01.370
It's also worth noting that all might's size doesn't equate to his strength again mild spoilers ahead

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:02.309
but in Chapter

00:07:02.309 --> 00:07:08.029
95 of the manga we see what happens when all might gives up one for all he has a few embers of his former power

00:07:08.029 --> 00:07:14.749
Left but they get used up he specifically says early on in the chapter the Embers inside me have vanished later

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:18.769
He talks more about it to Deku the embers of one-for-all inside me are gone

00:07:18.770 --> 00:07:25.730
And what's more I can't maintain my muscle form anymore now this tells us two interesting things first the way

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:31.489
This is phrased implies that his muscle form and One-for-all are two different things one for all is gone

00:07:31.490 --> 00:07:35.180
But also I can't maintain my muscle form anymore

00:07:35.310 --> 00:07:40.369
We also see him briefly transform into muscle form in these panels only to revert immediately back

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:46.220
But again if one for all were his only quirk and the embers were truly burned out like he says earlier in the chapter well then

00:07:46.220 --> 00:07:47.730
He shouldn't be able to do that

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:54.140
transformation at all !all of this would seem to suggest that all might wasn't born Quirkless that he possessed some sort of

00:07:54.420 --> 00:08:01.399
Transformation ability BEFORE he inherited one for all if you need more proof just look at how grantorino all might's trainer

00:08:01.530 --> 00:08:03.380
describes his early days with Hiro

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:08.239
He was pretty much able to use one for all right off the bat, of course he had the body going for him

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:14.480
So there's that the scene then cuts to a young all might getting trained and his body looks no different than Deku's he's still

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:16.700
Relatively skinny he's not super buff

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:20.899
And that's not all while discussing Deku's strength training all might even says to him

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:27.500
Offhandedly that for some reason he was able to access a hundred percent of one-for-all's power as soon as he inherited it

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:29.800
That's a weirdly specific detail to include isn't it

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:34.280
that means that there has to be something that set all might apart from Deku and allowed him to handle

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:39.709
All that excess energy when Deku can't despite both of them supposedly starting off Quirkless

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:41.400
So what would be so special and?

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:47.959
Significantly different about all might's body that would enable him to use powers right away without a Quirk that would differentiate him from Deku

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.950
It's hard to imagine an actual

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:57.140
Explanation here all of it seems to point to all might having some sort of hidden Quirk before he actually inherited one for all

00:08:57.440 --> 00:09:01.729
And it's not like latent undiscovered Quirks are unheard of in this universe in fact the very

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:08.839
Origin of one for all exists in an undiscovered almost vestigial quirk one for all was originally created by a villain named

00:09:09.089 --> 00:09:09.620
AFO

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:15.140
And if you think that gets confusing it does all for one's Quirk allowed him to transfer quirks between other

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:21.740
People now all for one's brother was seemingly born Quirkless so all for one gave his brother a quirk that allowed him to store

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:23.310
up power however

00:09:23.310 --> 00:09:29.700
Unknown to all for one his brother actually did have a Quirk one that allowed him to pass his quirks on to other

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:33.330
People it would have been totally useless on its own, but with the new quirk

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:41.069
That was added by his brother those two Quirks combined to create one for all this evil man had a Quirkless younger brother even though

00:09:41.070 --> 00:09:42.820
Everyone thought he was Quirkless

00:09:42.820 --> 00:09:49.349
turns out the brother did have a quirk he had a useless power that only allowed him to pass on quirks and

00:09:50.260 --> 00:09:54.210
SO the stockpiling ability merged with the younger brothers power

00:09:54.970 --> 00:10:00.540
And that is how one for all came to be so it's already canon that there can be latent or hidden

00:10:00.850 --> 00:10:03.510
Quirks in people so why not all might's

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:06.509
Here's the thing when you look at how it operates one for all

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:12.330
Isn't about muscle strength sure Deku needs the strength and up for ten months so inheriting the quirk doesn't destroy his limbs

00:10:12.330 --> 00:10:19.030
an unprepared body can't fully inherit it your arms and legs would shoot off if you tried to. SERIOUSLY!?

00:10:19.030 --> 00:10:23.699
Which in and of itself is a bit weird to begin with right? if all might were indeed

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:28.139
Quirkless to begin with and then receive the power and could suddenly use one for all from the get-go

00:10:28.240 --> 00:10:34.349
Wouldn't he just be under the impression that Deku could handle it as well anyway the actual power of one for all isn't

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:40.650
Mechanical power coming from muscles it actually works by storing up metabolic energy converting it to kinetic energy

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:42.749
And then channeling that energy through the body

00:10:42.760 --> 00:10:49.589
It's pretty easy to see this in action in Episode two we see all might punch so hard that it changes the weather pure super

00:10:49.589 --> 00:10:56.009
Strength isn't gonna do that you also see it in Deku when Deku uses one for all we see the air around him

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:58.860
Crackling with green energy. That's not just for show

00:10:58.860 --> 00:11:00.870
That's the excess energy of his Quirk

00:11:00.900 --> 00:11:04.949
overflowing from his body the same doesn't happen to all might because his

00:11:05.020 --> 00:11:11.129
Biceps are actually beefy enough to contain all of it inside him in which seems to indicate that perhaps all might's latent

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:15.989
Transformation quirk is to expand his muscles without really increasing his overall strength

00:11:15.990 --> 00:11:22.500
It's a seemingly useless quirk unless he inherits something that requires his body to store huge amounts of energy

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:25.950
Just like the creation of one for all to begin with a useless

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:30.559
Quirk on its own that becomes super powerful when combined with exactly the right

00:11:31.110 --> 00:11:32.000
complementary work

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:38.149
But lastly think about this before all might pass the Quirk on Deku the only goal of one for all users

00:11:38.279 --> 00:11:44.509
Passing on their power was to eventually create a superhero capable of taking down all for one that insanely powerful

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:50.420
Evil brother who literally had access to all the super powers in the world now with that as a pretty

00:11:50.550 --> 00:11:52.760
important goal would anyone in their right

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:55.429
mind entrust that power to someone with no

00:11:55.649 --> 00:12:01.849
Quirk of their own and thus no power of their own ?!if you're looking to keep hope alive that you'll defeat the world's strongest

00:12:02.550 --> 00:12:06.859
Supervillain that just wouldn't make any sense no the far more likely scenario

00:12:06.860 --> 00:12:12.709
Is that all might was chosen for his Quirk a Quirk that enabled him to be a bigger more powerful?

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:17.510
battery someone that was perfectly suited to use the power of one for all

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:20.839
Before inheriting one for all all might believed that he had no Quirk

00:12:20.839 --> 00:12:24.619
He said as much to Deku who found it hugely inspirational to hear that his hero

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:27.860
Also started out as a weak powerless Quirkless person

00:12:27.860 --> 00:12:33.890
but for as inspiring as a story as that is it's still just a story if you actually stop and look at the

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:36.890
classification of the Quirk how it behaves and even the

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:42.889
Motivations of the heroes passing one for all on all might must have had a Quirk before inheriting it from his predecessor

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:47.299
At best he wasn't aware of it until he acquired one for all at worst

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:52.880
